#: ../../tools/uniprot_proteomes_tools.rst:61 d832638921a540b8a7c1ea180c7dd2f5
msgid "**Name**: ``UniProt_search_proteomes``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/uniprot_proteomes_tools.rst:63 947d5decc18941e0810fc49dffd2f294
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the UniProt Proteome database for complete sets "
"of proteins expressed by organisms. Proteomes represent the complete set "
"of proteins from a fully sequenced genome. Supports searching by organism"
" name, taxonomy ID, BUSCO completeness, proteome type "
"(reference/representative/redundant), and more. Returns proteome IDs "
"(e.g., UP000005640 for human), gene counts, organism info, and quality "
"metrics. Useful for comparative genomics, finding model organism "
"proteomes, or identifying reference proteomes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/uniprot_proteomes_tools.rst:67 f3085e23da9a43d2942800adfab89f06
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query using UniProt query syntax. "
"Examples: 'organism\\_name:human', 'organism\\_id:9606', "
"'organism\\_name:escherichia coli', 'proteome\\_type:1' (reference), "
"'busco:complete>95.0'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/uniprot_proteomes_tools.rst:70 edf2539a2daf413b82dc3001d15954ef
msgid ""
"``size`` (integer) (optional) Number of results to return (default 10, "
"max 500)"
msgstr ""

